    "steam_appid": 1528230,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528230/extras/fa698c01e649aff5882cc13871c84b21.avif?t=1615478300\" /></div><br>Tabbris Yor is a role playing game in which you serve as a Special Agent for private security firm. In the final release of the game, you will be immersed in epic adventures and challenges throughout the solar system. In this Beta-release, alien terrorists have fled to a human outpost on Ganymede, the largest moon of Jupiter. You have been assigned to track them down and eliminate them. You are outnumbered - do you have the experience and the skills to accomplish your mission?<br><br>The game features challenging enemy AI, a weapon which you can load and unload, kill-counter, ammo and health counter, pedestrians that flee gunfights, an awesome sci-fi environment and your very own cyberpunk apartment!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528230/extras/fa698c01e649aff5882cc13871c84b21.avif?t=1615478300\" /></div><br>Tabbris Yor is a role playing game in which you serve as a Special Agent for private security firm. In the final release of the game, you will be immersed in epic adventures and challenges throughout the solar system. In this Beta-release, alien terrorists have fled to a human outpost on Ganymede, the largest moon of Jupiter. You have been assigned to track them down and eliminate them. You are outnumbered - do you have the experience and the skills to accomplish your mission?<br><br>The game features challenging enemy AI, a weapon which you can load and unload, kill-counter, ammo and health counter, pedestrians that flee gunfights, an awesome sci-fi environment and your very own cyberpunk apartment!",
    "short_description": "Tabbris Yor is a sci-fi TPS shooter (with switchable camera to FPS). Serving as a private security agent of a human colony on Ganymeade, the largest moon of Jupiter's largest moon, your mission is to find each of the aliens and eliminate them - before they eliminate you!",
